  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ieee80211-radio: add support for EHT BW 320MHz-2 support",
  "description": "Currently, Wireshark assumes that there is only one value to signal a 320MHz BW in EHT packets. However, there are two values (Table 36-28 (802.11be/D4.0)): 320MHz-1 and 320MHz-2. As a workaround to support 320MHz-2 and calculate its data rate, treat 320MHz-2 as if it was 320MHz-1 \n\nFixes #20272",
